graph TD
    classDef init fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef process fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef signal fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px;

    Start[User Deletes Project]:::init --> Emit[Emit 'PROJECT_DELETED' to Outbox]:::signal
    
    Emit --> L1[Listener picks up event]:::process
    L1 --> Q1{Are there Tasks?}:::process
    
    Q1 -->|Yes| D1[DELETE FROM project_task LIMIT 2000]:::process
    D1 --> ReEmit[Self-Signal: Emit 'PROJECT_DELETED' again]:::signal
    ReEmit --> L1
    
    Q1 -->|No| Done[Deletion Complete]:::init
